"{\n  \"agreementDate\": \"9 November 2021\",\n  \"placeOfSigning\": \"Maharashtra, India\",\n  \"supporting_documents\": [],\n  \"parties\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Ravi Ghai\",\n      \"address\": \"Flat No. 13, NCPA Residential Apartments, Dorab Tata Road, Nariman Point, Mumbai 400 021\",\n      \"phone\": \"\",\n      \"email\": \"\",\n      \"CIN\": \"\",\n      \"PAN\": \"\",\n      \"GST\": \"\",\n      \"obligations\": [\n        {\n          \"clauseNumber\": \"3\",\n          \"description\": \"Control 51% shares of the Promoters / Friends / Family Group in Graviss Hospitality Limited and bequeath to GG post his lifetime through Will.\",\n          \"clauseText\": \"RG shall control 51% shares of the Promoters / Friends / Family Group; it is agreed that the 51% shareholding controlled by RG will be bequeathed to GG post his lifetime, through his Will.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"clauseNumber\": \"4\",\n          \"description\": \"Gift INR 5,00,00,000 to GRG and provide for her personal, living and business expenses from the date of the Agreement.\",\n          \"clauseText\": \"The Parties hereby acknowledge that RG has gifted INR 5,00,00,000 (Indian Rupees Five Crores only) to GRG. The Parties hereby agree that from the date of this Agreement all of GRG’s personal, living and business expenses shall be provided for, and borne by, GG.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"clauseNumber\": \"6\",\n          \"description\": \"Bequeath right, title and interest in Flat No. 1203, Imperial Building, to GRG and her daughter, and write a fresh Will and Testament for all assets as he deems fit.\",\n          \"clauseText\": \"GRG hereby irrevocably undertakes that she will bequeath her right, title and interest in Flat No. 1203, admeasuring 1783.07 sq. ft. carpet area, 12th floor, together with the allotment of 2 car parking spaces in the building known as the Imperial Flat, to her daughter Ravina Bhojwani in her last will and testament. It also agreed that GG shall be responsible for the payment of all outstanding monthly installments with respect to the loan availed by GRG (Guaranteed by GG) from Axis Bank for the purchase of the Imperial Flat. RG hereby irrevocably agrees to bequeath through his last will and testament all amounts as he deems fit (remaining after any gifts that he may make in his lifetime as well as the payment of all his personal and living expenses) from the proceeds received by him pursuant to clause 1 above, as also all his other wealth as he deems fit. In consideration of the mutual promises and covenants contained herein, the Parties hereby agree, accept and acknowledge that, RG shall be fully and absolutely entitled and shall have the unfettered right to (a) make gifts during his lifetime of; and/or (b) make, and amend from time to time, his will and testament relating to, all or any of his assets (whether moveable, immoveable and whether located in India or elsewhere and including without limitation his current residence at Flat No. 13, NCPA Residential Apartments, Dorab Tata Road, Nariman Point, Mumbai 400 021). The Parties also hereby acknowledge and accept that all previous Wills and Testament stand null and void and RG will write a fresh Will and Testament for all his assets (moveable and non moveable) in India and abroad, as he deems fit.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Gaurav Ghai\",\n      \"address\": \"21-A, Maker Towers 'A', Cuffe Parade, Mumbai 400 005\",\n      \"phone\": \"\",\n      \"email\": \"\",\n      \"CIN\": \"\",\n      \"PAN\": \"\",\n      \"GST\": \"\",\n      \"obligations\": [\n        {\n          \"clauseNumber\": \"1\",\n          \"description\": \"Become the sole and absolute owner of Graviss Food Solutions Pvt Ltd and other Graviss Group companies (excluding Graviss Hospitality Ltd) and shares of Graviss Foods currently held by RG, free of encumbrances.\",\n          \"clauseText\": \"GG shall, from the date of this Agreement, pursuant to actions and steps that have been agreed between the Parties, become the sole and absolute owner of Graviss Food Solutions Private Limited, Graviss Foods Private Limited and other Graviss Group companies, excluding Graviss Hospitality Ltd and its shareholding entities (collectively, Graviss Foods). From the date of this Agreement, pursuant to actions and steps that have been agreed between the Parties, the entire right, title and interest (legal and beneficial) in and to the shares of Graviss Foods currently held by RG shall be conveyed free and clear of all encumbrances to the GG Group.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"clauseNumber\": \"3\",\n          \"description\": \"Control 49% of the Promoters / Friends / Family Group in Graviss Hospitality Limited. Operations of Graviss Group to be managed by GG.\",\n          \"clauseText\": \"GG shall control 49% of the Promoters / Friends / Family Group in Graviss Hospitality Limited. The Parties hereby agree that RG shall be the Non Executive Chairman of the Graviss Group, including companies in which GG or his family members have 100% shareholding, while the operations of the Graviss Group will be managed by GG.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"clauseNumber\": \"4\",\n          \"description\": \"Ensure RG is paid salary in UAE till 31st May 2024.\",\n          \"clauseText\": \"It is also agreed that GG will ensure that RG is paid as Salary Dhs 110,000pm in UAE till 31st May 2024.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"clauseNumber\": \"5\",\n          \"description\": \"Not to acquire or assist anyone to acquire further shares or voting rights in Graviss Hospitality Limited.\",\n          \"clauseText\": \"Each of the Parties agrees not to directly or indirectly acquire, or finance or assist anyone else to acquire/any further shares or voting rights in Graviss Hospitality Limited at any time in the future including following any potential de-listing of Graviss Hospitality Limited.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"clauseNumber\": \"6\",\n          \"description\": \"Responsible for payment of all outstanding monthly installments for the loan availed by GRG from Axis Bank for the purchase of the Imperial Flat.\",\n          \"clauseText\": \"It also agreed that GG shall be responsible for the payment of all outstanding monthly installments with respect to the loan availed by GRG (Guaranteed by GG) from Axis Bank for the purchase of the Imperial Flat.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Geeta Ravi Ghai\",\n      \"address\": \"Flat No. 1203, Imperial Building, South Tower, Tardeo, Mumbai 400 031\",\n      \"phone\": \"\",\n      \"email\": \"\",\n      \"CIN\": \"\",\n      \"PAN\": \"\",\n      \"GST\": \"\",\n      \"obligations\": [\n        {\n          \"clauseNumber\": \"6\",\n          \"description\": \"Bequeath right, title and interest in Flat No. 1203, Imperial Building, to her daughter Ravina Bhojwani in her last will and testament.\",\n          \"clauseText\": \"GRG hereby irrevocably undertakes that she will bequeath her right, title and interest in Flat No. 1203, admeasuring 1783.07 sq. ft. carpet area, 12th floor, together with the allotment of 2 car parking spaces in the building known as the Imperial Flat, to her daughter Ravina Bhojwani in her last will and testament.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"penalty_clauses\": [],\n  \"arbitration_clause\": {\n    \"amicable_settlement\": \"If any issue arises in the implementation of any of the provisions of this Agreement, or if any dispute or difference or question of interpretation arises, the same shall be amicably settled amongst them in the first instance.\",\n    \"arbitration\": \"In the event of failure to do so within a period of 90 days, the dispute shall be settled only by arbitration in accordance with the provisions of the Arbitration and Conciliation Act, 1996.\",\n    \"arbitral_tribunal\": \"\",\n    \"final_and_binding\": \"\",\n    \"seat_and_venue\": \"Mumbai, India\",\n    \"language\": \"English\",\n    \"costs\": \"\"\n  },\n  \"clauses\": [\n    {\n      \"clauseNumber\": \"1\",\n      \"description\": \"GG to become sole and absolute owner of Graviss Food Solutions Pvt Ltd and other Graviss Group companies (excluding Graviss Hospitality Ltd) and shares of Graviss Foods currently held by RG, free of encumbrances.\",\n      \"clauseText\": \"GG shall, from the date of this Agreement, pursuant to actions and steps that have been agreed between the Parties, become the sole and absolute owner of Graviss Food Solutions Private Limited, Graviss Foods Private Limited and other Graviss Group companies, excluding Graviss Hospitality Ltd and its shareholding entities (collectively, Graviss Foods). From the date of this Agreement, pursuant to actions and steps that have been agreed between the Parties, the entire right, title and interest (legal and beneficial) in and to the shares of Graviss Foods currently held by RG shall be conveyed free and clear of all encumbrances to the GG Group.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"clauseNumber\": \"2\",\n      \"description\": \"Any tax liability (Capital Gains / Income Tax / Stamp Duty), etc. will be solely borne by GG group of companies.\",\n      \"clauseText\": \"Any tax liability (Capital Gains / Income Tax / Stamp Duty), etc. will be solely borne by GG group of companies.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"clauseNumber\": \"3\",\n      \"description\": \"RG to control 51% shares of the Promoters / Friends / Family Group in Graviss Hospitality Limited and bequeath to GG post his lifetime through Will. GG to control 49%. RG to be Non Executive Chairman, GG to manage operations.\",\n      \"clauseText\": \"The Parties are aware of, approve and accept that, pursuant to actions and steps that have been agreed between the Parties, (a) RG shall control 51% shares of the Promoters / Friends / Family Group; (b) GG shall control 49% of the Promoters / Friends / Family Group in Graviss Hospitality Limited. It is agreed that the 51% shareholding controlled by RG will be bequeathed to GG post his lifetime, through his Will. The Parties hereby agree that RG shall be the Non Executive Chairman of the Graviss Group, including companies in which GG or his family members have 100% shareholding, while the operations of the Graviss Group will be managed by GG.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"clauseNumber\": \"4\",\n      \"description\": \"RG has gifted INR 5,00,00,000 to GRG. GG to ensure RG is paid salary in UAE till 31st May 2024. GG to provide for GRG's personal, living and business expenses from the date of the Agreement.\",\n      \"clauseText\": \"The Parties hereby acknowledge that RG has gifted INR 5,00,00,000 (Indian Rupees Five Crores only) to GRG. The Parties hereby agree that from the date of this Agreement all of GRG’s personal, living and business expenses shall be provided for, and borne by, GG. It is also agreed that GG will ensure that RG is paid as Salary Dhs 110,000pm in UAE till 31st May 2024.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"clauseNumber\": \"5\",\n      \"description\": \"Parties not to acquire or assist anyone to acquire further shares or voting rights in Graviss Hospitality Limited.\",\n      \"clauseText\": \"Each of the Parties agrees not to directly or indirectly acquire, or finance or assist anyone else to acquire/any further shares or voting rights in Graviss Hospitality Limited at any time in the future including following any potential de-listing of Graviss Hospitality Limited.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"clauseNumber\": \"6\",\n      \"description\": \"GRG to bequeath Flat No. 1203, Imperial Building, to her daughter. GG to pay outstanding loan installments. RG to bequeath all amounts as he deems fit through Will. RG to write fresh Will and Testament for all assets as he deems fit.\",\n      \"clauseText\": \"GRG hereby irrevocably undertakes that she will bequeath her right, title and interest in Flat No. 1203, admeasuring 1783.07 sq. ft. carpet area, 12th floor, together with the allotment of 2 car parking spaces in the building known as the Imperial Flat, to her daughter Ravina Bhojwani in her last will and testament. It also agreed that GG shall be responsible for the payment of all outstanding monthly installments with respect to the loan availed by GRG (Guaranteed by GG) from Axis Bank for the purchase of the Imperial Flat. RG hereby irrevocably agrees to bequeath through his last will and testament all amounts as he deems fit (remaining after any gifts that he may make in his lifetime as well as the payment of all his personal and living expenses) from the proceeds received by him pursuant to clause 1 above, as also all his other wealth as he deems fit. In consideration of the mutual promises and covenants contained herein, the Parties hereby agree, accept and acknowledge that, RG shall be fully and absolutely entitled and shall have the unfettered right to (a) make gifts during his lifetime of; and/or (b) make, and amend from time to time, his will and testament relating to, all or any of his assets (whether moveable, immoveable and whether located in India or elsewhere and including without limitation his current residence at Flat No. 13, NCPA Residential Apartments, Dorab Tata Road, Nariman Point, Mumbai 400 021). The Parties also hereby acknowledge and accept that all previous Wills and Testament stand null and void and RG will write a fresh Will and Testament for all his assets (moveable and non moveable) in India and abroad, as he deems fit.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"clauseNumber\": \"7\",\n      \"description\": \"Agreement constitutes the entire agreement and arrangement between the Parties and supersedes all previous and prior understandings.\",\n      \"clauseText\": \"Save and except as mentioned herein, this Agreement constitutes the entire agreement and arrangement between the Parties with respect to the subject matter hereof and supersedes all previous and prior understandings, arrangements and agreements whether oral or written signed by RG with GG with any of their respective family members.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"clauseNumber\": \"8\",\n      \"description\": \"Variation or amendment to the Agreement only if executed in writing and signed by all Parties.\",\n      \"clauseText\": \"The Parties agree that any variation or amendment to this Agreement shall be made if and only to the extent that each of the Parties execute another agreement in writing modifying the terms hereof.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"clauseNumber\": \"9\",\n      \"description\": \"Parties to make, sign and execute all necessary papers, deeds, documents, papers, share transfer forms, DP instructions, letters as may be required to give effect to the Agreement.\",\n      \"clauseText\": \"The Parties agree to make, sign and execute all necessary papers, deeds, documents, papers, share transfer forms, DP instructions, letters as may be required to give further effect to the Agreement.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"clauseNumber\": \"10\",\n      \"description\": \"Actions referred to in clauses 1, 2 and 5 to be taken simultaneously and none to be deemed taken until all have come into effect.\",\n      \"clauseText\": \"The actions referred to in clauses 1, 2 and 5 shall be deemed to have been taken and to have come into effect simultaneously and none of these actions shall be deemed to have been taken until all such actions have been taken and have come into effect.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"clauseNumber\": \"11\",\n      \"description\": \"All disputes to be settled amicably first, then by arbitration in Mumbai, India, in English, as per Arbitration and Conciliation Act, 1996.\",\n      \"clauseText\": \"The Parties agree that if any issue arises in the implementation of any of the provisions of this Agreement, or if any dispute or difference or question of interpretation arises, the same shall be amicably settled amongst them in the first instance. In the event of failure to do so within a period of 90 days, the dispute shall be settled only by arbitration in accordance with the provisions of the Arbitration and Conciliation Act, 1996. The seat and venue of the arbitration proceedings will be Mumbai, India and the language of the arbitration proceedings shall be English.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"clauseNumber\": \"12\",\n      \"description\": \"Each Party represents and warrants to the other Parties as to legal right, power, capacity, and voluntary execution of the Agreement.\",\n      \"clauseText\": \"Each Party represents and warrants to the other Parties as follows: (i) It has the full legal right, power, capacity and authority to enter into and perform its obligations under this Agreement and to consummate the actions contemplated under this Agreement; (ii) All action on the Party’s part required for the lawful execution and delivery of this Agreement has been taken. This Agreement constitutes a valid and binding obligation of the Party enforceable in accordance with its terms; (iii) It has voluntarily entered into this Agreement and without any duress or undue influence from any person.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"clauseNumber\": \"13\",\n      \"description\": \"Each Party agrees to keep confidential the terms of this Agreement and the matters, details and circumstances giving rise to and leading up to this Agreement.\",\n      \"clauseText\": \"Each Party agrees and undertakes to keep confidential the terms of this Agreement and the matters, details and the circumstances giving rise to and leading up to this Agreement.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"clauseNumber\": \"14\",\n      \"description\": \"If any clause or part of the Agreement is held invalid or unenforceable, the other clauses or parts shall continue to be binding.\",\n      \"clauseText\": \"If, for any reason, any clause or part of the Agreement is held invalid or unenforceable, then the other clauses or parts to the extent they are valid and enforceable, shall continue to be binding on the Parties.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"clauseNumber\": \"15\",\n      \"description\": \"Agreement may be executed in any number of counterparts, all of which together constitute one instrument.\",\n      \"clauseText\": \"This Agreement may be executed in any number of counterparts and all counterparts, taken together, constitute one instrument. A Party may execute this Agreement by executing any counterpart.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"